  "body_html": "<h1>Nash Equilibrium</h1>\n<p>A strategy profile $s\\in S$ is a Nash equilibrium if no player can profitably\ndeviate unilaterally:\n$$\n  g_i(t_i,s_{-i})\\le g_i(s_i,s_{-i})\n  \\quad\\text{for all } i\\in I,\\ t_i\\in S_i.\n$$\nEquivalently,\n$$\n  s_i\\in BR_i(s_{-i}) \\quad\\text{for every } i\\in I.\n$$</p>",
